  "description": "Integration tests for a FusionModules host, one topology at a time: a WebApplicationFactory that boots the host with the modules a test names, exactly as HOSTINGSTARTUPASSEMBLIES does in a deployment; settings that keep a topology test off the database and away from the modules' workers; and the host's routes with the module that serves each. Works with any test framework.",
